v 3
d slideviewer: navigate SMCL slides, presentations, and tutorials in the Stata Viewer
d
d slideviewer turns a folder of .smcl files into an interactive presentation or
d tutorial inside the Stata Viewer, so a deck needs no hard-coded Next and
d Previous links in each slide.  Move through the deck alphabetically with next,
d prev, first, and last; the navbar option injects a clickable
d [First] [Prev] [TOC] [Next] [Last] header and footer into any slide as it is
d shown.  slideviewer toc builds a clickable table of contents of every .smcl
d file in the project directory.  The project subdirectory is set once and
d remembered for the rest of the session.  Fully UTF-8 aware.
d
d Requires: Stata 16.0 or newer
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260725
d
f slideviewer.ado
f slideviewer.sthlp
